    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970413.0342\n\nBOGOTA, April 13 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENT Hostage release under way in Colombian prison seige\n\n\n\n\nThe 11 hostages who have been held by rioting inmates in a prison in Valledupar, Colombia, since April 3 were released Sunday under a deal negotiated with the prisoners.",
